# Cursor + gstack workflow (app)

gstack skills are installed globally under `~/.cursor/skills/gstack-*`.

## Branch + commit rules (enforced)

- **Never commit to `main`** (see `no-commit-to-main.mdc`)
- **Use Conventional Commits** (see `conventional-commits.mdc`)

## Shipping workflow

- Plan: `gstack-office-hours` → `gstack-autoplan` for non-trivial changes
- Review: `gstack-review`
- Security: `gstack-cso` for CI/CD + CloudFront/S3/IAM/security-sensitive changes
- PR: `gstack-ship`

## Deploy mapping (GitHub Actions → AWS)

This repo deploys from **GitHub Actions**, not from a laptop.

- Merge PR → push to `main` triggers `Deploy app.mnemospark.ai (CloudFront)` (`.github/workflows/deploy.yml`)
- Path filter: deploy runs only when `app/**`, `infra/cloudformation/app.yaml`, or the workflow file changes.

